	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas a <persName ref="p315">Bedrotto</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zum (nicht erhaltenen) Brief <persName ref="p315">Jakob Bedrots</persName> an <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> s. <bibl source="b42">Vadian BW V</bibl> 366.</note>, quas misi, te accepisse credo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hodie, quę responsa sunt <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>a vobis et a <placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint sind die von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> und <persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> und <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> eingeholten Stellungnahmen zur <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberger</placeName> Konkordie; s. oben <ref target="file10918">Nr. 877</ref>, 9-30, bzw. <ref target="file10919">Nr. 878</ref>.</note>, dimissa sunt a dominis nostris <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">In der missive <placeName ref="l28">Basels</placeName> an <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> vom 30. August (s. <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> II 693) sind diese Beilagen nicht erwähnt; möglicherweise ging jedoch ein separates, nicht erhaltenes Schreiben an <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName> und <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>spe forti rem cessuram feliciter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Scripsit interim <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> huc ad <persName ref="p1365">Grynęum</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. oben <ref target="file10926">Nr. 885</ref>, 16-31.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>unde video (tam omnia sunt clara) concordiam non posse impediri <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nisi per adfectuum improbitatem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Utinam nos ab his simus (quod cer<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te spero) quam liberrimi!</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scopus negocii videtur hic esse: Christus totus editur <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>fide, ut fides edere potest et ut Christus a fide comedi potest.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et quis n<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>egaret illud?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De indignis quęstio facilis videtur, dum consyderantur Corinthii, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quos Paulus hoc nomine vocat, et clausula recte perpenditur, quam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>idem ad finem adnectit: "At cum iudicamur, a domino corripimur, ne cum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mundo damnemur"<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 11, 32</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rumor volat concordiam esse factam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Minim <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>profecto, quam gaudeant boni, etiam, qui iamdum foris sunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ringantur <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>autem papistae, quod discordia nostra foti sint hactenus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sperant adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>aliquid interlapsurum, quod consilium remoretur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Illud non capimus, cum<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>am <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> senatum vestrum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">vestrum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> monuerint, ne conventum communem celerius, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quam par sit, congregent; prius enim et alios rogandos esse<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> hatte die in einer <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Missive vom 21. August (Zürich StA, E I 1. 2b) enthaltene Bitte am 24. August an <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> weitergeleitet (Basel StA, Kirchenakten A 4, 167).</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hic si quid potes, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>responde.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="411"/>Fuit hodie apud me ex <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName> vir, adfinis <persName ref="p21356">Leonis</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="7">Gemeint ist wohl <persName ref="p21356">Jakob Schmid</persName>, Metzger und später Spitalmeister in <placeName ref="l1605">Bergheim</placeName> (<placeName ref="l632">Elsaß</placeName>), Ehemann von <persName ref="p1753">Leo Juds</persName> Schwester <persName ref="p6440">Clara</persName> und Vater von <persName ref="p8009">Johannes Fabricius</persName>; s. <bibl source="b39">Graubünden, Korr.</bibl> II, S. VII.</note>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>diligenter quęsivit de valitudine eius.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dixerat se esse, credo, sororium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Qui literas ferunt, viri nobiles sunt et pii, alter <persName ref="p19919">a Pfirt</persName>, alter <persName ref="p19920">a <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Stouufen</persName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>vor</hi> Stouufen <hi>gestrichenes</hi> Stöu[?].</note><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Weiche Angehörigen der beiden Adelsgeschlechter <persName ref="p19919">von Pfirt</persName> und <persName ref="p19920">von Staufen</persName> gemeint sind, ließ sich nicht feststellen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quod dico, ut excipiatis, ut dignum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Communes sint <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hae cum <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Vertigo prohibuit et tempus, ne scribere po<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tuerim ambobus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluto uxorem<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="9"><persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Ehefrau <persName ref="p4300">Rosilla Rordorf</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, omnes.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 31. augusti anno 1536.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Myco<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D[ominis] <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bibliandro</persName> seu <persName ref="p495">Bul<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>lingero</persName>, fratribus in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
